<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<otrs_package version="1.1">
    <Name>ITSMConfigurationManagement</Name>
    <Version>11.0.14</Version>
    <Vendor>Rother OSS GmbH</Vendor>
    <URL>https://otobo.io/</URL>
    <License>GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE Version 3, 29 June 2007</License>
    <ChangeLog Date="2026-04-24 12:28:32" Version="11.0.14">- Add simple license management.
- Update to OTOBO 11.0.16.
- Various bug fixes. Treat names as raw strings in CIFetch (#45), error log on failing DFSync (#73), CI list in CUIC does not paginate (#78), value validation for GenericInterface (#85), #75, #80</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2026-02-04 16:51:35" Version="11.0.13">Incorporated changes around dynamic field handling of the OTOBO Core of issues #4790 and #4843, targeted at MultiValue fields.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2025-12-17 13:36:07" Version="11.0.12">Update to OTOBO 11.0.14; Removed hardcoded counters for permission conditions (Issue #70);</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2025-11-12 09:42:03" Version="11.0.11">Prevent hiding pages showing only non dynamic field content on ConfigItemEdit.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2025-11-07 09:15:51" Version="11.0.10">- ImportExport: Add possibility to import/export sets on single entry level; Sets and Multivalue fields can &quot;keep empty values&quot; for complete fields (no single entry changes).
- Rework AgentITSMConfigItemPrint to be based on visible page content, show description and backlink sections.
- Added history comments for attachment add and delete.
- Various bug fixes, among them issues #66, #59, #63, #65, #58, #54, #21, #61, #15, #56, #57, #52</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2025-08-15 10:37:47" Version="11.0.9">Improve and fix ConfigItemAdd and -Update TransitionActions. Add a mapping SysConfig for Set fields.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2025-08-14 13:15:07" Version="11.0.8">- Several bugfixes, Issues #17, #39, #47, #49, #51, #53, among others.
- Fixed Regresseion of 11.0.7 where the UpgradeTo11 Console script broke for Subs-&gt;Sets.
- Enable usage of custom &quot;Module&quot; sections.
- Rework how CurInciStateRecalc is triggered from various places.
- Added some more documentation.
- Add new Process TransitionAction: ConfigItemUpdate.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2025-05-13 10:04:33" Version="11.0.7">- Issue #41: The number of ConfigItems shown in the overview was not correctly used with OTOBO 11.0.9.
- Fix a bug with Excluded Deployment states in ES.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2025-05-06 15:56:09" Version="11.0.6">- Update to OTOBO 11.0.9.
- Fix Elasticsearch</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2025-05-05 12:40:38" Version="11.0.5">- Added a max height to CI Link sections.
- Temporarily remove old Link Count routine. (Will be replaced in an upcoming release.)
- Added interoperability with DynamicFieldScreens and
- changed SysConfig structure of DynamicFields for search and overview.
- Fix CMDB notifications and add a small doc.
- Added support for searching dynamic field Set inner fields in agent frontend.
- Various Bugfixes.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2025-03-06 07:23:29" Version="11.0.4">- Use All as default category.
- Update ReadyToImport classes.
- Only trigger Version updates when things changed.
- Added OTOPar CI DynamicField and CI Attributes migrations.
- Various bugfixes</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2024-12-04 06:48:57" Version="11.0.3">- Added various webservice invokers and operations.
- Added documentation.
- Improve some linking situations in the tree view.
- Change internal link directions to align with the standard.
- Added external source parameter for importing/exporting CIs with reference fields (also for webservices).
- Various bug fixes and smaller changes.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2024-06-21 10:46:57" Version="11.0.2">- Minor naming corrections in the ReadyToAdopt classes
- Improved class export for sets
- Enable defaults for AgentITSMConfigItemSearch
- Implemented cache usage for DefinitionOutOfSync check.
- Enable CodeMirror editor also for role editing.
- Fixed CI counting for AgentITSMConfigItem.
- Added sysconfig to define columns for AgentITSMConfigItemSearch overview.
- Fixed category handling on class import.
- Other minor fixes.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Date="2024-05-27 13:44:51" Version="11.0.1">Large rework of the CMDB which replaces the XML storage with dynamic fields, and provides a new and highly configurable ConfigItemZoom for both agents and customers.</ChangeLog>
    <Description Lang="en">The OTOBO::ITSM Configuration Management package.</Description>
    <Description Lang="de">Das OTOBO::ITSM Configuration Management Paket.</Description>
    <Description Lang="es">El paquete OTOBO::ITSM Configuration Management.</Description>
    <Description Lang="hu">Az OTOBO::ITSM konfigurációmenedzsment csomag.</Description>
    <Framework Minimum="11.0.14">11.0.x</Framework>
    <IntroInstall Lang="en" Title="Install Information" Type="pre">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;WELCOME&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        You are about to install the OTOBO package ITSMConfigurationManagement.&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;NOTE&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        The ITSMConfigurationManagement 11 has undergone major changes.&lt;br/&gt;
        It is necessary to migrate your existing ConfigItem classes to the new structure. This can be done via the Console script bin/otobo.Console.pl Admin::ITSM::ConfigItem::UpgradeTo11.
        During its execution the definitions will be updated and dynamic fields for all custom (old xml) attributes will be created.&lt;br/&gt;
        Bundles of new default classes are available and can be imported in Admin-&gt;ConfigItems.&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED OTOBO PACKAGES&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;ITSMCore 11.0.4&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Lang="de" Title="Installation Information" Type="pre">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;WILLKOMMEN&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Sie sind im Begriff das OTOBO-Paket ITSMConfigurationManagement zu installieren.&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;HINWEIS&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Das Paket ITSMConfigurationManagement wurde mit der Version 11 stark überarbeitet.&lt;br/&gt;
        Nach dem Upgrade von 10.1 müssen bestehende ConfigItem-Klassen zusätzlich auf die neue Struktur migriert werden. Hierzu steht das Console-Kommando bin/otobo.Console.pl Admin::ITSM::ConfigItem::UpgradeTo11 zu Verfügung.
        Dieses ändert die ConfigItem-Klassendefinitionen auf die neue Struktur und legt dynamische Felder für alle konfigurierbaren (d.h. die bisherigen xml-) Attribute an.&lt;br/&gt;
        Neue default-Klassen können unter Admin-&gt;ConfigItems direkt importiert werden.&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;BENÖTIGTE OTOBO-PAKETE&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;ITSMCore 11.0.4&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Lang="es" Title="Install Information" Type="pre">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;BIENVENIDO&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Usted está punto de instalar el paquete ITSMConfigurationManagement de OTOBO.&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;NOTA&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        El módulo ITSMConfigurationManagement 11 ha sufrido cambios mayores.&lt;br/&gt;
        Es necesario migrar sus definiciones existentes de clases de elementos de configuración (ConfigItems) a la nueva estructura.
        Esto puede ser realizado ejecutando el comando de consola: bin/otobo.Console.pl Admin::ITSM::ConfigItem::UpgradeTo11.
        Durante su ejecución, se actualizarán las definiciones de ConfigItems y se crearán nuevos campos dinámicos para todos los atributos personalizados existentes (antigua estructura XML).&lt;br/&gt;
        Una serie de nuevas clases por defecto están disponibles y pueden ser importadas mediante la opción: Admin-&gt;ConfigItems.&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;PAQUETES OTOBO REQUERIDOS&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;ul&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;ITSMCore 11.0.4&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Lang="en" Title="Installation Information" Type="post">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;NOTICE&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        In order to grant users access to the config item menu, you need to add them as member to the group 'itsm-configitem'.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        The menu items that were added by this package will be visible after you log-in to the system again.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Lang="de" Title="Installation Information" Type="post">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;HINWEIS&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Um Benutzern Zugriff auf das ConfigItem-Menü zu gewähren, müssen diese Mitglied der neuen Gruppe 'itsm-configitem' sein.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Die von diesem Paket hinzugefügten Menü-Punkte sind erst nach einem erneuten Anmeldevorgang im System sichtbar.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Lang="es" Title="Installation Information" Type="post">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;ATENCIÓN&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Para permitirles a los usuarios el acceso al menú de los elementos de configuración, es necesario que se den de
        alta como miembros del grupo 'itsm-configitem'.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Los elementos del menú que se agregaron por este paquete, serpan visibles después reiniciar la sesión al sistema.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroInstall>
    <IntroInstall Lang="hu" Title="Telepítési információk" Type="post">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;FIGYELMEZTETÉS&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Annak érdekében, hogy hozzáférést adjon a felhasználók számára a konfigurációelem menühöz, hozzá kell adnia őket az „itsm-configitem” csoporthoz tagként.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Azok a menüpontok, amelyeket ez a csomag adott hozzá, azután lesznek láthatóak, miután ismét bejelentkezik a rendszerbe.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroInstall>
    <IntroUninstall Lang="en" Title="Uninstallation Information" Type="pre">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;ATTENTION&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        If you uninstall this package, all database tables that were created during installation will be deleted.
        All data from these tables will be irrevocably lost!
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        The group 'itsm-configitem' that was created during package installation will be deactivated.
        You can activate this group again in the admin area.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        All links to config item objects will be irrevocably deleted!
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        The statistics that are associated with this package, will no longer be available if the package is uninstalled.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroUninstall>
    <IntroUninstall Lang="de" Title="Uninstallation Information" Type="pre">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;ACHTUNG&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Bei der Deinstallation werden die von diesem Paket angelegten Datenbank-Tabellen gelöscht.
        Alle darin enthaltenen Daten gehen unwiderruflich verloren!
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Die von diesem Paket angelegte Gruppe 'itsm-configitem' wird deaktiviert.
        Sie kann jederzeit im Admin-Bereich wieder aktiviert werden.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Alle Verknüpfungen zu ConfigItem-Objekten werden unwiderruflich gelöscht!
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Nach der Deinstallation sind die zu diesem Paket zugehörigen Statistiken nicht mehr verfügbar.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroUninstall>
    <IntroUninstall Lang="es" Title="Uninstallation Information" Type="pre">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;ATENCIÓN&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Si usted desinstala este paquete, todas las tablas de la base de datos que fueron creadas durante su instalación se eliminarán.
        ¡Todos los datos de dichas tablas se perderán irrevocablemente!
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        El grupo 'itsm-configitem' que se creó durante la instalación de este paquete se desactivará.
        Es posible reactivar este grupo en el área de administración.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ¡Todos los vínculos a objetos de elementos de configuración serán eliminados permanentemente!
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Si usted desinstala este paquete, las estadísticas que están asociadas a él ya no estarán disponibles.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroUninstall>
    <IntroUninstall Lang="hu" Title="Eltávolítási információk" Type="pre">

        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;FIGYELEM&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Ha eltávolítja ezt a csomagot, akkor a telepítés során létrehozott összes adatbázistábla törlésre kerül.
        Az ezekben a táblákban lévő összes adat visszavonhatatlanul el fog veszni!
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        A csomagtelepítés során létrehozott „itsm-configitem” csoport ki lesz kapcsolva.
        Ezt a csoportot az adminisztrációs területen tudja ismét bekapcsolni.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        A konfigurációelem objektumokra mutató összes hivatkozás visszavonhatatlanul törölve lesz!
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        Az ehhez a csomaghoz hozzárendelt statisztikák többé nem lesznek elérhetők, ha a csomag eltávolításra kerül.
        &lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;
        ((enjoy))&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;br/&gt;

    </IntroUninstall>
